bring to boil in a pot
 - 28 oz canned whole tomato in purée
 - small grated carrot
 - 1 tsp basil
 - 1/2 tsp oregano
 - pinch thyme
 - pinch savory
reduce to fast simmer

set large sauté pan on high
add
 - 2 tbsp olive oil
 - 600 g hot Italian sausage meat
cook completely
process sauce with hand blender
add meat to sauce and leave fat behind
drain some fat if needed
add
 - 1 minced onion
cook 5 minutes
add to sauce
simmer 10 minutes

enough for 500g pasta
serves 4-6

